    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Across living and fossil vertebrates, estimate regional mass distribution and measure the position and height of neural spines, then test whether anterior and posterior bending moments predict spine-height maxima after phylogenetic correction.";
